    "title": "Man arrested in connection to 2019 murder of teen boxer in San Antonio - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago SAN ANTONIO — The San Antonio Police Department has arrested a man in connection to the 2019 murder of George Ramos, who was 18 at the time of his death. Back on June 20, 2019, Ramos was found dead inside of an SUV off Culebra Road after police said he was shot several times following a meet up with, what SAPD suspected at the time, two other people. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
